# Negative control — widens `ModuleRef.variant` back to an unguarded `string`
# and drops `MODULE_REF_TAG`'s requirement, so a slot assignment naming an
# undeclared variant can be written as a bare object literal instead of going
# through `moduleRef()` (design.md §D3/§D4, AC2.4, tasks.md 1.10e).
#
# Intended RED: an assertion that the plain-literal shape —
# `{ kind: "module", id: FIXTURE_MODULE_ID, variant: "form" }` — fails
# `pnpm --filter @upmind-automation/portal-nuxt type-check` the same way
# `moduleRef(FIXTURE_MODULE_ID, { variant: "form" })` already does. No such
# assertion exists yet: the committed fixture
# `app/portal/type-tests/module-variant-closure.typecheck.ts` only exercises
# the `moduleRef()` call form — the one authoring position this control does
# NOT touch — so it stays green through this mutation. Filed for the prover
# to pair with the plain-literal position.
#
# Confirmed by isolating both shapes in one file, one run, before filing:
# the `moduleRef()` call still errors (TS2322 — that check lives in its own
# generic call signature, untouched by this mutation); the plain literal
# with the same undeclared variant compiles clean. Exactly one error comes
# out of a file carrying both.
#
# Rebased (fix round 1, tasks.md 2.7): `ModuleRef` grew an optional `props`
# field (config-owned module data) on both branches of the union. The
# mutation is unchanged in kind — collapse the two-branch union into one
# shape with an unguarded optional `variant` and an optional
# `MODULE_REF_TAG` — `props` carries through untouched on the mutated shape.
# Re-verified by direct execution against the rebased source: applying this
# patch reproduces the exact same TS2578 "Unused '@ts-expect-error' directive"
# at module-variant-closure.typecheck.ts:38, `nuxt typecheck` EXIT=2.
# REBASED 2026-08-25 (board-conformance): the group branch / ModuleRef context
# moved. Same mutation, new anchors — asserted unique before mutating.

--- a/apps/portal-nuxt/app/portal/types.ts
+++ b/apps/portal-nuxt/app/portal/types.ts
@@ -92,21 +92,13 @@
